DEFINE CLASS locapcom AS form 
 	*< CLASSDATA: Baseclass="form" Timestamp="" Scale="" Uniqueid="" />

	*-- OBJECTDATA items order determines ZOrder / El orden de los items OBJECTDATA determina el ZOrder 
	*< OBJECTDATA: ObjPath="List1" UniqueID="" Timestamp="" />

	*<PropValue>
		AutoCenter = .T.
		BackColor = 158,199,174
		BorderStyle = 0
		Caption = "Porcentajes"
		DoCreate = .T.
		Height = 150
		Icon = ..\imagen\litening.ico
		MaxButton = .F.
		Name = "LOCAPCOM"
		Width = 172
		WindowType = 1
	*</PropValue>

	ADD OBJECT 'List1' AS listbox WITH ;
		ColumnCount = 2, ;
		ColumnWidths = "35,60", ;
		FontBold = .T., ;
		Height = 113, ;
		Left = 26, ;
		Name = "List1", ;
		RowSource = "''", ;
		RowSourceType = 2, ;
		Top = 15, ;
		Width = 120
		*< END OBJECT: BaseClass="listbox" />
	
	PROCEDURE Init
		parameter letrapor
		
		frmlocapor= conectar_db(_screen.cn)
			SQLEXEC(frmlocapor,"select concat('   ',TRIM(porc_desc)) as porc_desc,concat(' %   ',TRIM(cast(porc_impo as char))),porc_codi,porc_impo from porcencomi order by porc_codi;","cur_porc")
		desconectar_db(frmlocapor)
		
		thisform.list1.RowSource="cur_porc"
	ENDPROC

	PROCEDURE Unload
		return letrapor
	ENDPROC

	PROCEDURE List1.Click
		if this.selected(this.listindex)
			letrapor=cur_porc.porc_codi
			thisform.release
		endif
		
	ENDPROC

	PROCEDURE List1.KeyPress
		LPARAMETERS nKeyCode, nShiftAltCtrl
		if nkeycode=13
			if this.selected(this.listindex)
				letrapor=cur_porc.porc_codi
				thisform.release
			endif
		endif
	ENDPROC

ENDDEFINE
